        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "EXAMPLE For the <EMAID> \"DE-0008AA-1A2B3C4D5\" first all leading zeros within the elements and separators are removed, resulting in the significant characters \"DE8AA1A2B3C4D5\". The 14 characters of \"DE8AA1A2B3C4D5\" are transcoded to values, resulting in the <value string> \"1314810101102113124135\" and the <CHECKSUM> \"15664971\". The modulo-11 computation results in the <Check Digit> \"3\" which is appended to the <EMAID> to form the correct string \"DE-8AA-1A2B3C4D5-3\".",
